AuraPass — notices and attribution
==================================

AuraPass is an independent project. It is not affiliated with, endorsed by, or
derived from the source code of Enpass, 1Password, Bitwarden, KeePass or any
other password manager. It reimplements ideas that are common to the genre —
a local encrypted vault, a browser bridge, importers — from public
specifications and documentation.

The name "Enpass" and the names of other products appear only to describe
import compatibility.

